    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Myaka makūmi anè mu matogolo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho tūkīnga ī lipandī lyenīlo, tūūgalūka tūūdima nzīla ya kūja kwitogolo lya kūjīlīīla kū nyanza yaza, gīt'ūmo walī wanilagīīlīla ū SEEBA. Myaka mingī īkabīta tūkwipīndīlaga ng'witogolo lya sī ja magūlya ga Seili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūniwīla gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lyang'wigelaga lūūlū ī likanza lya kūyeela yeela ū mu sī ya magūlya yenīyī, ī haha galūkagi mulole sukuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Binhage a banhū ī shilagīlo īshi; ūbawīle gīkī, ‘Ī haha mulī bbihī kūbīta mu sī ya baana bang'wing'we, a ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Esau, abo bakikalaga mu sī ya Seili. A boi bakūng'ogoha no, alīyo shing'wigelelile kwilang'hana gete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutizūbikoloosha nose bakandya kūlwa būlūgū ning'we, nguno natūūng'winhaga ī sī yabo; yaya nūūlū ni katogolo kado kakūtūūla lūpambala dūhū. Ī sī ya magūlya ga Seili naamala kūng'winha Esau, īlī yakwe ī yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukūfunya hela ja kūshigūla ī shilīwa shabo īsho mulaalye, na a minzī ayo mulatūmamīle.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we wamufuuhile ū mu milīmo ying'we ī yose īyo mukūtūmamaga na makono. Wamulang'hanile ū mu lūgendo lwing'we ū ng'witogolo na būtaale walyo ī lyose īlī. Ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we walī hamò ning'we ū ng'wikanza lya myaka makūmi anè, na mutageehelilwe shikolo shose shose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana tūkabīta ū mu sī ya badūgū bise, a ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Esau abo bakikalaga mu Seili. Tūūgalūka twīnga ū ng'wikūūwa lya Alaba, īlo lītulumenhile kūfuma kū magūlya ga Elasi na Ezioni-geba; tūja n'ikūūwa lya kūbītīla ng'witogolo lya Moabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū SEEBA ūniwīla hangī, “Ilang'hanagi mutizūbikoloosha a Bamoabu, nose mukabasayīcha bandye kwilwisha būlūgū ning'we. Nguno natūng'winha ī sī yabo nūūlū katogolo kado. Ī sī ya Aali naamala kūbinha ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Lutu, īlī sī yabo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Ū mu sī yenīyo ī kale bikalaga Baemu, banhū ba nguzu, nīyo bingī, hama balīhu gītī Baanaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo baabalagwa gīkī balī Balefai,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Balefai:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Banhū abo baalī na mibīlī mitaale; nūūlū madaaji.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " alīyo a Bamoabu baabitanaga Baemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu sī ya Seili bikalaga Bahooli ī kwandya, alīyo a banhū ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Esau būbapyena; būbapeeja moi bikala mo boi a ha ng'wanya gwabo, gīt'ūmo bakīītīla Baisilaeli ū mu sī īyo SEEBA walī wabinha kūbiza yabo.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ū SEEBA ūhaya, “Ī haha lūūlū būkagi mugūkīle ū mongo gwa Zaledi.” Na ng'hana tūūgagūkīla ū mongo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma a h'ikanza lya kwīnga Kadeeshi-balinea kūshisha a ha kūgūkīla ū mongo gwa Zaledi, īkabīta myaka makūmi adatū n'īnaane. Ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo pye a bagoosha abo baalī badūgije kūbiza ng'wibità lya kūlwa būlūgū bakacha; pyī ī shibyalīlwe shabo shūshila, gīt'ūmo SEEBA walī wabilahīlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA walī wabagoloolela nkono, kūshisha ūbamala pye gete ū mu ng'hambī ngima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū aho baakalīka a bagoosha abo baalī badūgije kūlwa būlūgū, aho bashila kūcha pye a bose gete, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū SEEBA ūniwīla gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ī lelo īyī mukūbītīla Aali mulūkīle ū lūbīmbī lwa Moabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū mulashike ū mu sī ya Baamoni yaya ū kūbikoloosha, nose mubasayīche bandye kwilwisha būlūgū ning'we. Nguno natūng'winha ī sī ya Baamoni nūūlū katogolo kado; ī sī yenīyo naamala kūbinha ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Lutu, īlī sī yabo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Ī sī yenīyo nayo yalī ībalilwe gīkī yalī ya Balefai, abo bikalaga mo ī kale; a Baamoni babitanaga Bazamuzumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalī banhū ba nguzu, nīyo bingī, hama balīhu gītī Baanaki. Ū SEEBA akabakenaagūla būshila ho, bīsola Baamoni ī sī yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo akītīla ū SEEBA nū mu kūbagunanha a ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Esau, abo bikalaga mu sī ya Seili, aho akabakenaagūla a Bahooli ūbapeeja būbīngīla, biza bigasha boi ū mu sī yenīyo a ha ng'wanya gwabo, kūshisha lelo īyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalīho na banhū bitanagwa Baavi, baalī bazengile mu magūngūli malebe, bīsambaalīla ī sī kūshisha mu Gaza, a bene bakakenaagūlwa na banhū ba kūfuma Kafutooli, būyīsola ī sī yabo, bikala mo a Bakafutooli.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Na lūūlū būkagi muje nalo ū lūgendo lwing'we, mugūkīle ū mongo gwa Alinoni. Managi gīkī ū Sihoni ū ntemi wa Heshiboni ū muna Amoli, nantūūlile mu makono ging'we, pye nī sī yakwe. Ndumīlagi ī haha ng'wandye būlūgū nag'hwe, ng'wīsole ī sī yenīyo, ībize ying'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lelo īyī nakwandya kūgoolecha a magaka ging'we ū kū mahanga pye ayo galī ha sīlīlī y'igūlū; būlī bene abo balalwigwe ū lūkumo lwing'we nakūbatūūlīla booba bang'ogohe, bandye kūdetema na kūzwangana kūlwa nguno ying'we.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūpyenwa kwa ng'wa Sihoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho twashika ng'witogolo lya Kedemoti nakatūma banhū ū kūlī Sihoni, ū ntemi wa Heshiboni, kūntwalīla mihayo ya kūlomba mhola. Nūng'wīla gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tūzunīlījage tūbīte ū mu sī yako. Tūkūbīta ng'wikūūwa dūhū, tūtūgalūka kū nkono gwa būlyo nūūlū gwa lūmoso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shilīwa sha kūlya na a minzī ayo tūlatūmamīle tūgūgījage, tūkwinhe ī hela gīt'ūmo gūlī ū mpango gwasho. A bise tūlīkūlomba ūtūzunīlīje tūbīte dūhū, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gīt'ūmo baalī batūzunīlīgije banhū ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Esau abo bakikalaga Seili; na a Bamoabi abo bakikalaga mu sī ya Aali. Tūtogilwe kūgūkīla ū mongo gwa Yolodani tūje mu sī yise, īyo SEEBA alītwinha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Sihoni akalema ū kūtūzunīlīja ū kūbīta, nguno ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we walī wagwīta ū moyo gwakwe gūbiza ndaamu, wīgagabaja ī ng'holò yakwe gīkī antūūle mu makono ging'we, gīt'ūmo wītīlile ī haha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūniwīla, “Ī haha nandyaga kūntūūla ū Sihoni nī sī yakwe mu makono gako; na lūūlū nang'ho andyaga ū kwīdima ī sī yakwe, wīsole ībize yako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Sihoni nī libità lyakwe aho watūsanga Yahazi kwiza kwamba būlūgū nise, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū SEEBA Mulungu wise ūntūūla mu makono gise, tūntūla ūyagaala na a bitūnja bakwe, pye nī libità lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo twīdima pyī ī mizengo yakwe, tūbamala kūbabūlaga pye a banhū baamo, bagosha, bakīma, na a banīgīnī. Tūtalekile mo munhū mpanga nūūlū ūmò! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī mitugo nī shikolo īsho tūkasola mu mizengo, ī shene tūshijana shūbiza shise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye hose hose, kwandīja ū nzengo gwa Aloe ūyo gūlī bbihī na mongo gwa Alinoni, nū nzengo ūyo gūlī ū mu ntubīlo gwa mongo, kūshisha Gileadi, gūtigelile nūūlū gūmò ūyo gwalī gūdūgije kūtūpyena. Ū SEEBA Mulungu wise akatwinha pyī ī mizengo yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike mukīīta gīt'ūmo SEEBA Mulungu wise walī watūlagīīlīla, mutasakamīlile sī yose yose ya Baamoni, nūūlū sī jose jose ījo jilī kū mbalama ya mongo gwa Yaboki, nūūlū ī mizengo ya kū sī ja magūlya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
